#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:9
msgid "OS 可移植接口交付与验收清单"
msgstr "OS portable interface delivery and acceptance checklist"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:11
msgid ""
"本清单记录公共接口、后端和消费者迁移的交付内容及验收条件。接口范围与取舍见 [OS 现行架构](../explanation/os-"
"portability.md)；本文保留 32 个稳定任务 ID、 优先级和依赖，不复制第二份 API 合同。"
msgstr ""
"This checklist records deliverables and acceptance criteria for public "
"interfaces, backends and consumer migration. See the [current OS "
"architecture](../explanation/os-portability.md) for scope and tradeoffs. "
"This page retains 32 stable task IDs, priorities and dependencies without "
"duplicating the API contract."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:15
msgid ""
"**状态：公共实现与阶段验收已交付，最终集成验收进行中。** OSU-22／23 根据 实际需求盘点明确不纳入本批；HIL 继续暂缓，保持 "
"`not_executed`。 阶段结果不能提前关闭最终集成、ARM、资源和 SDK 验收。当前调用要求与生命周期以 [OS "
"执行合同](../reference/contracts/os/execution.md)为准。 软件实施覆盖 "
"FreeRTOS、ThreadX、Native 的已维护范围，裸机保留非阻塞能力。 不因此新增 CPU、SoC、Board、安全配置或实板资格。"
msgstr ""
"**Status: common implementation and stage validation have been delivered; "
"final integration acceptance is in progress.** OSU-22/23 are explicitly "
"excluded from this batch based on actual requirements. HIL remains deferred "
"and `not_executed`. Stage results cannot prematurely close final "
"integration, ARM, resource or SDK acceptance. The [OS execution "
"contract](../reference/contracts/os/execution.md) governs current calling "
"requirements and lifecycles. Software implementation covers the maintained "
"FreeRTOS, ThreadX and Native scope; baremetal retains nonblocking "
"mechanisms. This does not add CPU, SoC, Board, security-profile or physical-"
"board qualification."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:22
msgid ""
"本轮开发阶段已有 32 项新公共接口测试、18 个保留的旧 GoogleTest／CTest 模块和 9 项外部示例检查通过。它们分别验证三后端实际生产"
" C、既有故障合同和示例消费， 不是最终完整集成或所有硬件配置的通过声明；最终关闭需匹配相关源码、配置及报告。"
msgstr ""
"This development iteration has passed 32 new public-interface tests, 18 "
"retained GoogleTest/CTest modules and 9 external example checks. They "
"validate actual production C across three backends, existing failure "
"contracts and example consumption respectively. They do not declare final "
"complete integration or every hardware configuration passed; final closure "
"requires matching source, configuration and reports."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:26
msgid "范围、复用与完成口径"
msgstr "Scope, reuse and completion criteria"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "已有机制"
msgstr "Existing mechanism"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "本轮处理"
msgstr "Work in this iteration"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "保留的边界"
msgstr "Boundary retained"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "公共 wait、单等待者通知和绝对 deadline"
msgstr "Public wait, single-waiter notifications and absolute deadlines"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "复用生产 C 与合同，补统一类型入口"
msgstr "Reuse production C and contracts; add common typed entry points"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "wake 是提示，真实 predicate 才决定完成"
msgstr "A wake is a hint; the authoritative predicate determines completion"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "三后端任务和外部 join"
msgstr "Tasks and external join across the three backends"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "迁入统一源码接口，复用已有退出算法"
msgstr "Migrate to a common source API and reuse existing teardown algorithms"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "成功 join 才能回收任务存储"
msgstr "Task storage is reclaimable only after successful join"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "静态队列与可关闭队列"
msgstr "Static queues and closable queues"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "保留不同成本档位，统一选定语义"
msgstr "Retain separate cost tiers and unify the selected semantics"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "不让普通队列默认承担广播和 waiter 成本"
msgstr "Ordinary queues do not carry broadcast and waiter costs by default"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "CPU port、ISR 准入与掩码保护"
msgstr "CPU ports, ISR admission and mask protection"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "沿用精确端口和上下文检查"
msgstr "Retain exact ports and context checks"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "不把主机通过推广成 MCU IRQ 资格"
msgstr "Host success does not establish MCU IRQ qualification"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "TOML、typed IR、CMake 与 Source SDK"
msgstr "TOML, typed IR, CMake and Source SDK"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "保留硬件装配链，增加选定目标的软件能力校验"
msgstr ""
"Retain the hardware assembly chain and add software capability validation "
"for the selected target"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "不引入第二份配置权威或源码图"
msgstr "Do not introduce a second configuration authority or source graph"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "GoogleTest／GoogleMock、资源夹具和门禁"
msgstr "GoogleTest/GoogleMock, resource fixtures and gates"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "补缺失合同，按实现类别复用"
msgstr "Add missing contracts and reuse coverage by implementation class"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "不重建测试、台账或证据框架"
msgstr "Do not rebuild test, ledger or evidence frameworks"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:37
msgid ""
"静态存储使用所选后端的真实大小和对齐，不使用全部后端的最大联合体。 统一源码 API 不承诺统一二进制布局；切换后端需要重新编译、配置存储和评估调度。 "
"不增加运行时后端选择、隐藏 worker、默认 timer daemon 或对象池。"
msgstr ""
"Static storage uses the actual size and alignment of the selected backend, "
"rather than the largest union across all backends. A common source API does "
"not promise a common binary layout. Switching backends requires "
"recompilation, storage configuration and scheduling assessment. Do not add "
"runtime backend selection, hidden workers, a default timer daemon or object "
"pools."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:41
msgid ""
"优先级 P0 表示冻结后续工作依赖的合同或集成阻塞；P1 表示完成可移植消费链所需 实现；P2 "
"表示由真实消费者决定的可选扩展。依赖栏中的编号均指本页稳定任务 ID。 任务在相关代码、测试、文档及验证一起满足退出条件后才能关闭，不能仅以提交数 "
"或新增接口数量判定完成。"
msgstr ""
"P0 freezes contracts required by later work or resolves integration "
"blockers; P1 implements the portable consumer chain; P2 denotes optional "
"extensions justified by real consumers. Numbers in the dependency column "
"refer to stable task IDs on this page. Close a task only when the relevant "
"code, tests, documentation and validation together meet its exit criteria. "
"Commit counts or the number of new interfaces are not completion criteria."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:46
msgid "WP1：冻结合同与真实消费者"
msgstr "WP1: freeze contracts and real consumers"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:48
msgid ""
"合同与真实消费路径已经落入公共头和维护夹具。下面保留各项退出条件，后续改动 继续从具体消费者出发，不为凑齐原生 API 名称增加没有使用者的功能。"
msgstr ""
"Contracts and real consumption paths now reside in public headers and "
"maintained fixtures. The following exit conditions remain applicable to "
"later changes, which continue to start from concrete consumers rather than "
"adding unused functionality to complete a native API list."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "任务"
msgstr "Task"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "优先级／依赖"
msgstr "Priority / dependencies"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "改动与产物"
msgstr "Changes and deliverables"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "退出条件"
msgstr "Exit criteria"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-01"
msgstr "OSU-01"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P0／无"
msgstr "P0 / none"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "盘点 OS 头、组件及外部示例调用，区分业务、装配与原生扩展"
msgstr ""
"Inventory OS headers, component calls and external examples; distinguish "
"business logic, assembly and native extensions"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "每个现有公开后端入口有保留、内部化或删除决定，无悬空消费者"
msgstr ""
"Every existing public backend entry has a retain, internalize or delete "
"decision; no consumer is left unresolved"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-02"
msgstr "OSU-02"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P0／01"
msgstr "P0／01"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "冻结单位、错误、Task／IRQ、优先级、join、关闭和存储合同"
msgstr ""
"Freeze contracts for units, errors, Task/IRQ contexts, priorities, join, "
"close and storage"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "三后端语义差异逐项有实现策略或显式拒绝，不以同名函数代替语义"
msgstr ""
"Each semantic difference across the three backends has an implementation "
"strategy or explicit rejection; common function names do not substitute for "
"semantics"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-03"
msgstr "OSU-03"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P0／02"
msgstr "P0／02"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "选定已有 owner 及生产者／消费者流程，记录等价原生基线"
msgstr ""
"Select an existing owner and producer/consumer flow; record an equivalent "
"native baseline"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "同一业务源码覆盖正常、超时、关闭和退出；输入、负载和容量固定"
msgstr ""
"One business source covers normal operation, timeout, close and exit with "
"fixed inputs, workload and capacities"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-04"
msgstr "OSU-04"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P0／02、03"
msgstr "P0／02、03"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "为首个统一接口增加 C 头编译及实际行为 RED，记录实施交接"
msgstr ""
"Add C-header compilation and actual behavior RED tests for the first common "
"interface; record the implementation handoff"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "RED 确因待实现合同失败；并行实现者收到原始命令和源码快照后开始"
msgstr ""
"RED fails because of the contract awaiting implementation; parallel "
"implementers start only after receiving the original command and source "
"snapshot"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:58
msgid ""
"合同冻结同时列出不纳入项：强制杀任务、通用 scheduler shutdown、运行时换内核、 透明裸机阻塞线程和未维护的 MPU／TrustZone"
" 组合。后续新增需求先说明消费者， 再修改现行架构和对应合同。"
msgstr ""
"Contract freeze also records exclusions: forced task termination, generic "
"scheduler shutdown, runtime kernel switching, transparent blocking threads "
"on baremetal and unmaintained MPU/TrustZone combinations. Identify a "
"consumer before adding a requirement, then update the current architecture "
"and relevant contract."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:62
msgid "WP2：类型、静态存储与构建选择"
msgstr "WP2: types, static storage and build selection"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:64
msgid "本包把后端布局限制在装配及私有实现。普通业务只接收公共类型，不包含内核头， 不根据后端设置预处理分支。"
msgstr ""
"This package confines backend layouts to assembly and private "
"implementation. Ordinary business logic receives public types, includes no "
"kernel headers and has no backend-dependent preprocessor branches."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-05"
msgstr "OSU-05"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "定义公共对象引用、初始化参数及选定后端存储声明边界"
msgstr ""
"Define public object references, initialization parameters and the boundary "
"for selected-backend storage declarations"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "公共业务头可单独按 C11 编译，未泄露 TCB、原生 handle 或 tick 类型"
msgstr ""
"Public business headers compile independently as C11 without exposing TCB, "
"native handle or tick types"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-06"
msgstr "OSU-06"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P0／05"
msgstr "P0／05"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "实现精确存储类型及容量、对齐、跨度和生命周期检查"
msgstr ""
"Implement exact storage types and capacity, alignment, span and lifecycle "
"checks"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "不足、溢出、重叠及错误配置在产生效果前拒绝，无最大池和非法类型别名"
msgstr ""
"Reject insufficient storage, overflow, overlap and invalid configuration "
"before effects; no maximum-size pool or invalid type aliasing"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-07"
msgstr "OSU-07"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P0／05、06"
msgstr "P0／05、06"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "用现有 CMake 目标选定存储布局和后端，覆盖 Platform／Runtime"
msgstr ""
"Select storage layouts and the backend through existing CMake targets for "
"Platform/Runtime"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "一幅镜像只有一套任务实现，混合后端身份在生成时拒绝；未选内核不进入该镜像"
msgstr ""
"Each image has one task implementation; mixed backend identities reject "
"during generation, and unselected kernels do not enter that image"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-08"
msgstr "OSU-08"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／02、07"
msgstr "P1／02、07"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "通过选定目标的能力元数据校验软件需求，保留裸机轻路径"
msgstr ""
"Validate software requirements through capability metadata on the selected "
"target; retain the lightweight baremetal path"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "缺能力在配置或编译期拒绝，helper 不隐式链接；新增同 CPU MCU 不需重写 OS 工具"
msgstr ""
"Missing capabilities reject at configuration or compilation; the helper does"
" not link implicitly, and adding an MCU with the same CPU contract does not "
"require rewriting OS tools"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:74
msgid ""
"不为对象尺寸另建独立清单或手写 magic number。生成连接与 C 类型定义共用现有 "
"权威来源；配置器不实现内核行为。对象布局随后端变化时，消费者完整重编译。 独立 Host "
"夹具可以在同一构建图生成不同后端的可执行文件，每幅镜像分别校验身份。 公共 `storage.h` 不根据整仓 Native 配置误选 RTOS "
"夹具布局。"
msgstr ""
"Do not create a separate object-size manifest or handwritten magic numbers. "
"Generated connections and C type definitions share the existing "
"authoritative sources; the configurator does not implement kernel behavior. "
"Rebuild consumers completely when the selected backend changes object "
"layouts. Independent Host fixtures may build executables with different "
"backends in the same graph, validating each image identity separately. "
"Public `storage.h` does not incorrectly select RTOS fixture layouts from "
"repository-wide Native configuration."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:79
msgid "WP3：任务、引导与真实退出"
msgstr "WP3: tasks, bootstrap and actual teardown"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:81
msgid "复用各后端已经存在的生命周期算法。统一的是任务入口与成功退出后的资源保证， 不要求三个内核具有相同的创建时机。"
msgstr ""
"Reuse the lifecycle algorithms already implemented by each backend. Unify "
"task entry and resource guarantees after successful teardown without "
"requiring identical creation phases across the three kernels."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-09"
msgstr "OSU-09"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／04、06、07"
msgstr "P1／04、06、07"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "接入可返回任务与永久任务，保留静态 TCB、栈、唯一 lifecycle owner"
msgstr ""
"Integrate returnable and permanent tasks; retain static TCBs, stacks and a "
"unique lifecycle owner"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "返回、创建失败、自 join 和真实删除路径正确；永久任务不承担完成对象成本"
msgstr ""
"Return, creation failure, self-join and real deletion paths are correct; "
"permanent tasks do not carry completion-object costs"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-10"
msgstr "OSU-10"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／02、09"
msgstr "P1／02、09"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "提供统一产品引导入口，封装 FreeRTOS／ThreadX／Native 创建阶段"
msgstr ""
"Provide a common product bootstrap entry that encapsulates "
"FreeRTOS/ThreadX/Native creation phases"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "回调范围、可调用操作、首任务执行时机及失败责任明确；Platform 不启动 scheduler"
msgstr ""
"Define callback scope, allowed operations, first-task execution timing and "
"failure responsibility; Platform does not start the scheduler"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-11"
msgstr "OSU-11"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／09、10"
msgstr "P1／09、10"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "完成 Native 有限 deadline join，保留真实 pthread 会合"
msgstr ""
"Implement Native join with finite deadlines while retaining real pthread "
"joining"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "超时不 detach、不取消、不释放存储；成功确认无内核引用，不用无界 join 冒充有限等待"
msgstr ""
"Timeout does not detach, cancel or release storage; success proves kernel "
"references are gone; unbounded join does not masquerade as finite waiting"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-12"
msgstr "OSU-12"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／02、08、10"
msgstr "P1／02、08、10"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "映射公共逻辑优先级，定义 host 执行及调度能力边界"
msgstr ""
"Map public logical priorities and define host execution and scheduling "
"capability boundaries"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "MCU 顺序映射无反转；Native 无 RT 能力时明确拒绝硬保证，不静默钳位"
msgstr ""
"MCU mappings preserve priority order; Native explicitly rejects hard "
"guarantees without RT capability rather than silently clamping values"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:91
msgid ""
"ThreadX 的引导回调、FreeRTOS 启动前对象创建和 Native 线程立即执行需要在适配器 "
"内部协调。实际内核启动只能由外部工程显式调用，入口返回不能被当成可回收证明。 不增加统一的强制终止接口来掩盖合作式停止依赖。"
msgstr ""
"The adapter must coordinate ThreadX bootstrap callbacks, FreeRTOS object "
"creation before scheduler startup and immediate Native thread execution. "
"Only the external project explicitly starts the real kernel; entry return is"
" not proof that storage is reclaimable. Do not add a common forced-"
"termination interface to conceal cooperative-stop dependencies."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:95
msgid "WP4：通知、等待与发布者撤回"
msgstr "WP4: notifications, waiting and publisher withdrawal"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:97
msgid "本包保持现有 ready／arm／ready／wait 协议，消除消费方显式选择内核通知对象的 需要。单端口仍只有一个等待者。"
msgstr ""
"This package retains the existing ready/arm/ready/wait protocol and removes "
"the need for consumers to select kernel notification objects explicitly. "
"Each port still has only one waiter."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-13"
msgstr "OSU-13"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／02、05；运行接入另依赖 07、09、10"
msgstr "P1 / 02, 05; runtime integration also requires 07, 09, 10"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "统一 wait／select 及 task-only sleep_until／yield，不复制 deadline 工具"
msgstr ""
"Unify wait/select and task-only sleep_until/yield without duplicating "
"deadline tools"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "公共等待可先完成；延时／yield 在后端与任务上下文稳定后验收，覆盖过期、量化与非法上下文"
msgstr ""
"Public waiting may complete first; validate sleep/yield after backend and "
"task contexts stabilize, including expiry, quantization and invalid contexts"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-14"
msgstr "OSU-14"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／06、09、13"
msgstr "P1／06、09、13"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "连接各后端通知；直接任务通知作为明确选择的后端优化"
msgstr ""
"Connect backend notifications; keep direct task notification as an "
"explicitly selected backend optimization"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "同一消费者不含后端分支；优化不隐占通知槽，不扩大单等待者合同"
msgstr ""
"The same consumer has no backend branches; optimizations neither claim "
"notification slots implicitly nor expand the single-waiter contract"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-15"
msgstr "OSU-15"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／08、14"
msgstr "P1／08、14"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "分开 Task 与允许的 ISR 唤醒入口，复用 IRQ ceiling／掩码检查"
msgstr ""
"Separate Task and permitted ISR wake entry points; reuse IRQ ceiling and "
"mask checks"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "非法优先级、异常、权限或屏蔽状态在对象变更前拒绝，合法路径保留原掩码"
msgstr ""
"Reject invalid priorities, exceptions, privileges or mask states before "
"object changes; permitted paths preserve incoming masks"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-16"
msgstr "OSU-16"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／11、14、15"
msgstr "P1／11、14、15"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "在实际 owner 消费链落实发布者停止、会合及通知销毁"
msgstr ""
"Implement publisher stop, joining and notification destruction in the real "
"owner consumption chain"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "SETTLED 后仍在执行的发布者不能访问已回收存储；无隐藏退出线程"
msgstr ""
"A publisher still executing after SETTLED cannot access reclaimed storage; "
"no hidden teardown thread"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:107
msgid ""
"`nx_sleep_until` 使用同域绝对 deadline，拒绝 `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER`，不承诺微秒 调度精度、不隐建 "
"timer。`nx_task_yield` 只提出调度提示，不是公平性或等待完成证明。 TIMEOUT 只表示本次等待预算结束，不能撤销已接受 I/O "
"的借用。取消、排空失败及 QUARANTINED 的责任继续沿用 Core 和 provider 合同；不把通知销毁当成取消设备。 运行中的内核继续保留"
" platform clock／Tick；仅在全部消费者静默且所选内核生命周期 允许时撤回，不承诺通用 scheduler "
"shutdown，不在内核运行期间直接关闭它们。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_sleep_until` uses an absolute deadline in the same domain, rejects "
"`NX_DEADLINE_NEVER`, and neither promises microsecond scheduling precision "
"nor creates an implicit timer. `nx_task_yield` is only a scheduling hint, "
"not proof of fairness or wait completion. TIMEOUT ends only this wait budget"
" and does not revoke accepted I/O loans. Cancellation, drain failure and "
"QUARANTINED responsibilities retain the Core and provider contracts; "
"destroying a notification does not cancel a device. A running kernel retains"
" the platform clock/Tick. Withdraw them only after every consumer is "
"quiescent and the selected kernel lifecycle permits it. Do not promise "
"generic scheduler shutdown or disable them directly while the kernel is "
"running."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:114
msgid "WP5：普通队列与可关闭 channel"
msgstr "WP5: ordinary queues and closable channels"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:116
msgid "复用已有字节队列和关闭协议。原始队列与可关闭通信通道保留分开的类型或明确 配置，使固定常驻关系可以选择更小的对象。"
msgstr ""
"Reuse existing byte queues and close protocols. Keep separate types or "
"explicit configuration for raw queues and closable channels so that fixed "
"permanent relationships can select smaller objects."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-17"
msgstr "OSU-17"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／02、06、07"
msgstr "P1／02、06、07"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "统一有界字节复制队列、try 与绝对 deadline 操作"
msgstr ""
"Unify bounded byte-copy queues, try operations and absolute-deadline "
"operations"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "单位、立即就绪优先、输出保持及缓冲区所有权一致，执行真实内核队列路径"
msgstr ""
"Units, immediate-readiness precedence, output preservation and buffer "
"ownership are consistent; execute real kernel queue paths"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-18"
msgstr "OSU-18"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／14、17"
msgstr "P1／14、17"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "接入可关闭 channel、调用者 waiter 和 drain 协议"
msgstr ""
"Integrate closable channels, caller-owned waiters and the drain protocol"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "close 拒绝新发送、唤醒阻塞者、保留旧数据；drained 且 users 退出后才能销毁"
msgstr ""
"close rejects new sends, wakes blocked users and retains old data; "
"destruction requires drained state and exited users"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-19"
msgstr "OSU-19"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／15、17、18"
msgstr "P1／15、17、18"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "固定 queue／channel transfer 的运行态 Task-only 范围"
msgstr "Fix queue/channel transfers to running Task-only scope"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "deadline 0 也不能在 bootstrap 传输；本批无 ISR transfer，IRQ 使用受审通知入口"
msgstr ""
"Even deadline 0 cannot transfer during bootstrap; this batch has no ISR "
"transfer, and IRQs use reviewed notification entry points"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-20"
msgstr "OSU-20"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／03、16、18"
msgstr "P1／03、16、18"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "迁移真实生产消费流程，固定满队列、停止、迟到 wake 行为"
msgstr ""
"Migrate the real producer/consumer flow; fix full-queue, stop and late-wake "
"behavior"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "执行 owner 在排空期间继续运行；大 payload 使用稳定引用时有独立借用闭环"
msgstr ""
"The execution owner keeps running during drain; stable references for large "
"payloads have their own complete loan lifecycle"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:126
msgid ""
"等待者数量和 payload 大小分别决定广播与复制成本。配置明确最大并发 waiter， 不创建全局池；性能报告分开记录调度暂停与 IRQ "
"屏蔽，不能混成一次主机耗时。"
msgstr ""
"Waiter count and payload size determine broadcast and copy costs "
"respectively. Configuration states the maximum concurrent waiters without a "
"global pool. Performance reports distinguish scheduler suspension from IRQ "
"masking rather than combining them into one host elapsed time."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:129
msgid "WP6：同步原语需求与范围决定"
msgstr "WP6: synchronization requirements and scope decision"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:131
msgid ""
"OSU-21 已盘点生产组件：同步通过窄端口注入，未直接依赖公共跨 OS mutex 或计数 "
"semaphore。当前任务与通信消费链不需要新增这两类原语，因此 OSU-22／23 明确不 纳入本批，没有新增 "
"`mutex.h`／`semaphore.h` 或占位实现。原生内核具备相应能力， 不表示 Nexus "
"已提供公共支持。下表保留未来真正选入时必须满足的合同。"
msgstr ""
"OSU-21 has inventoried production components: synchronization is injected "
"through narrow ports, without direct dependence on a public cross-OS mutex "
"or counting semaphore. The current task and communication consumer chain "
"needs neither new primitive, so OSU-22/23 are explicitly excluded from this "
"batch. No `mutex.h`/`semaphore.h` or placeholder implementation has been "
"added. Native-kernel capabilities do not establish public Nexus support. The"
" table retains contracts required if these primitives are genuinely selected"
" later."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-21"
msgstr "OSU-21"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／01、02、20"
msgstr "P1／01、02、20"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "列出确需跨后端互斥或计数同步的消费者及最小合同"
msgstr ""
"List consumers that genuinely require cross-backend exclusion or counting "
"synchronization and define their minimum contracts"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "每种新增原语有真实用例；无消费者的选项有排除理由，不进入默认镜像"
msgstr ""
"Each added primitive has a real use case; unused options have an exclusion "
"rationale and do not enter default images"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-22"
msgstr "OSU-22"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P2／06、12、21"
msgstr "P2／06、12、21"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "公共 mutex 本批不纳入；后续选入须明确 owner、递归及优先级继承"
msgstr ""
"Public mutex is excluded from this batch; later inclusion requires "
"ownership, recursion and priority inheritance to be defined"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "排除依据为 OSU-21；未来实现仍须覆盖非 owner 释放、自锁及不支持协议，不降级硬要求"
msgstr ""
"OSU-21 establishes the exclusion; a future implementation must still cover "
"non-owner unlock, self-lock and unsupported protocols without weakening hard"
" requirements"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-23"
msgstr "OSU-23"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P2／06、15、21"
msgstr "P2／06、15、21"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "公共 semaphore 本批不纳入；后续选入须明确饱和与 ISR 范围"
msgstr ""
"Public semaphore is excluded from this batch; later inclusion requires "
"saturation behavior and ISR scope to be defined"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "排除依据为 OSU-21；未来实现仍须覆盖计数上界、超限、超时及销毁前置条件"
msgstr ""
"OSU-21 establishes the exclusion; a future implementation must still cover "
"count limits, over-limit failures, timeouts and destruction preconditions"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-24"
msgstr "OSU-24"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／17、21"
msgstr "P1／17、21"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "统一所选阻塞操作的 deadline、错误和输出语义"
msgstr ""
"Unify deadline, error and output semantics for selected blocking operations"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "不新增相对超时换算器；不把不支持原生能力映射成成功或无限等待"
msgstr ""
"Do not add another relative-timeout converter or map unsupported native "
"capabilities to success or infinite waits"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:143
msgid ""
"普通业务不能用 semaphore 替代带所有权的 mutex。受限用户任务、跨安全域同步和 "
"内核专属抢占控制仍属扩展范围，未完成准入不能放进公共默认能力。"
msgstr ""
"Ordinary business logic must not substitute a semaphore for an ownership-"
"bearing mutex. Restricted user tasks, synchronization across security "
"domains and kernel-specific preemption control remain extensions; they "
"cannot enter public default capabilities without admission."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:146
msgid "WP7：迁移消费者与交付入口"
msgstr "WP7: migrate consumers and delivery entry points"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:148
msgid ""
"采用一次性源码迁移，不保留旧 API shim、别名或兼容门面。先保证目标消费者能 完成同一流程，再删除旧公开入口，避免留下两套竞争的维护路径。"
msgstr ""
"Use a one-time source migration without old API shims, aliases or "
"compatibility facades. First ensure target consumers can complete the same "
"flow, then delete old public entry points to avoid competing maintenance "
"paths."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-25"
msgstr "OSU-25"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／09、14、17、24"
msgstr "P1／09、14、17、24"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "迁移平台消费点，删除退役公开头、声明及重复连接"
msgstr ""
"Migrate platform consumption points; delete retired public headers, "
"declarations and duplicate connections"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "旧入口无生产引用；原生类型仅留后端布局、实现及明确扩展，允许装配依赖布局头，业务头不泄漏"
msgstr ""
"Old entry points have no production references; native types remain only in "
"backend layouts, implementations and explicit extensions; assembly may "
"depend on layout headers, but business headers do not expose them"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-26"
msgstr "OSU-26"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／16、20、25"
msgstr "P1／16、20、25"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "审核组件、I/O 和 SoC 依赖，维持窄端口注入"
msgstr ""
"Review component, I/O and SoC dependencies; retain narrow-port injection"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "设备日常 I/O 不强制经过 OS；公共组件无内核条件分支或隐藏 worker"
msgstr ""
"Ordinary device I/O is not forced through OS; public components have no "
"kernel-dependent branches or hidden workers"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-27"
msgstr "OSU-27"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／10、12、20、25"
msgstr "P1／10、12、20、25"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "在独立 nexus-examples 仓迁移任务装配、配置、锁和示例"
msgstr ""
"Migrate task assembly, configuration, locks and examples in the separate "
"nexus-examples repository"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "同一业务源码在选定 RTOS 运行；两仓提交分别绑定，不把应用移入平台"
msgstr ""
"The same business source runs on selected RTOS backends; bind commits "
"separately for both repositories without moving applications into the "
"platform"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-28"
msgstr "OSU-28"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／07、25、27"
msgstr "P1／07、25、27"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "更新 Source SDK 导出与外部 Platform／CPU Runtime 消费者"
msgstr "Update Source SDK exports and external Platform/CPU Runtime consumers"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "搬迁后的 SDK 可独立配置、链接及运行适用消费者，无 checkout 私有路径泄漏"
msgstr ""
"The relocated SDK independently configures, links and runs applicable "
"consumers without private checkout path leaks"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:158
msgid ""
"常规应用只使用公共合同；主动采用 MPU、TrustZone、直接通知槽或特有调度机制的 "
"适配留在产品基础设施层。业务源码可移植不等于原生扩展、存储预算和实时参数 无需重新评估，也不承诺跨工具链、ABI 的二进制兼容。"
msgstr ""
"Ordinary applications use public contracts. Adaptation that deliberately "
"uses MPU, TrustZone, direct notification slots or special scheduling "
"mechanisms stays in the product infrastructure layer. Business source "
"portability does not eliminate reassessment of native extensions, storage "
"budgets or real-time parameters, and does not promise binary compatibility "
"across toolchains or ABIs."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:162
msgid "WP8：测试、资源审查与软件退出"
msgstr "WP8: testing, resource review and software exit"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:164
msgid ""
"验证沿用[开发工作流](workflow.md)和[工程手册](../reference/contracts/engineering.md)。 "
"新行为在所属工作包先真实 RED 后 GREEN，以下任务负责整合与交付，不能把 TDD 延迟到最后补写。接口缺失的编译／链接 RED "
"与容量、名称等运行期缺陷 RED 分开 记录，不能把前者冒充全部行为的运行期 RED。纯文档修改不新增镜像实现测试。"
msgstr ""
"Validation follows the [development workflow](workflow.md) and [engineering "
"handbook](../reference/contracts/engineering.md). New behavior receives an "
"actual RED run before GREEN in its own work package. The following tasks "
"integrate and deliver that work; TDD must not be postponed until the end. "
"Compile/link RED for missing interfaces is recorded separately from runtime "
"defect RED for capacity, names and other behavior; the former must not "
"masquerade as runtime RED for every behavior. Pure documentation changes do "
"not add tests that mirror implementation."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-29"
msgstr "OSU-29"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／04、20、24、26"
msgstr "P1／04、20、24、26"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "合并 GoogleTest／GoogleMock 合同与真实内核探针，审查重复覆盖"
msgstr ""
"Integrate GoogleTest/GoogleMock contracts and real-kernel probes; review "
"duplicate coverage"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "测试生产 C；保留超时、迟到发布、join、关闭和实例隔离负例；不只验证 mock 次数"
msgstr ""
"Test production C; retain negative cases for timeout, late publication, "
"join, close and instance isolation; do not merely check mock call counts"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-30"
msgstr "OSU-30"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／12、19、22、23、29"
msgstr "P1／12、19、22、23、29"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "选择有区分意义的 CPU／ABI／IRQ 变体，记录等价 ELF 成本"
msgstr ""
"Select CPU/ABI/IRQ variants with meaningful distinctions; record equivalent "
"ELF costs"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "与 OSU-03 同工具、优化、能力及负载比较，分开 Flash、对象、栈和总 RAM"
msgstr ""
"Compare against OSU-03 using the same tools, optimization, capabilities and "
"workload; distinguish Flash, objects, stacks and total RAM"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-31"
msgstr "OSU-31"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／25、27、28、30"
msgstr "P1／25、27、28、30"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "更新当前合同、README、架构图、教程及英文 catalog"
msgstr ""
"Update current contracts, READMEs, architecture diagrams, tutorials and the "
"English catalog"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "正文与实际实现一致；严格双语与 SDK 引用通过，删除过时入口和错误支持表述"
msgstr ""
"Content agrees with actual implementation; strict bilingual and SDK "
"reference checks pass, removing obsolete entry points and incorrect support "
"claims"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "OSU-32"
msgstr "OSU-32"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "P1／28、29、30、31"
msgstr "P1／28、29、30、31"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "独立审查最终源码并执行现有完整集成、相关 ARM／SDK 门禁"
msgstr ""
"Independently review final source and execute existing complete integration "
"gates and relevant ARM/SDK gates"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:0
msgid "真实非空报告绑定最终源码与配置，无旧报告代替；遗留边界与 HIL 状态如实记录"
msgstr ""
"Real nonempty reports bind final source and configuration without "
"substituting old reports; record remaining boundaries and HIL status "
"accurately"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:176
msgid ""
"OSU-30 对 OSU-22／23 的依赖由 OSU-21 的明确排除决定满足；两类原语不标为 "
"已实现或已支持。通用算法按实现类别验证一次，编译变体保留其独有 ABI、掩码、FP／MVE、 MPU 或安全合同；不展开所有 "
"CPU、板卡、后端、优化和功能的笛卡尔积。"
msgstr ""
"The explicit OSU-21 exclusion decision satisfies OSU-30 dependencies on "
"OSU-22/23; neither primitive is marked implemented or supported. Validate "
"common algorithms once per implementation class. Compile-time variants "
"retain their distinct ABI, mask, FP/MVE, MPU or security contracts rather "
"than expanding the Cartesian product of all CPUs, boards, backends, "
"optimization levels and features."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:180
msgid "顺序、并行与效率"
msgstr "Order, parallel work and efficiency"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:182
msgid ""
"公共头和存储合同冻结后，三个后端按各自目录并行；消费方使用相同 C11 公共 业务源，后端测试 runner 分别维护，不在业务中添加内核条件分支。"
msgstr ""
"After public headers and storage contracts freeze, the three backends "
"proceed in parallel within their own directories. Consumers use the same "
"public C11 business source, with separate backend test runners and no "
"kernel-dependent branches in business code."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:184
msgid "每个并行任务有明确文件范围；同一维护构建目录通过显式交接串行使用。 汇总已发现的合同修正后执行所需完整门禁，不为每项任务重复全仓工具测试。"
msgstr ""
"Each parallel task has an explicit file scope; stages sharing a maintained "
"build directory are serialized by explicit handoff. Integrate discovered "
"contract fixes before running the required complete gates rather than "
"repeating repository-wide tool tests for each task."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:186
msgid "普通后端公开入口完成一次性迁移，专有扩展保留明确命名，不增加兼容门面。 生产组件与应用分仓，示例锁定和 SDK 消费需分别绑定实际平台提交。"
msgstr ""
"Ordinary backend public entry points have completed a one-time migration, "
"while backend-specific extensions retain explicit names without "
"compatibility facades. Production components and applications stay in "
"separate repositories; example locks and SDK consumption must each bind the "
"actual platform commit."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:188
msgid "日常反馈使用维护的相关目标；最终运行范围沿用现有工具选择，不加过滤来冒充 完整验收，不缓存成功报告，不绕过提交门禁。"
msgstr ""
"Use maintained relevant targets for daily feedback. Final execution follows "
"existing tool scope selection without filters that masquerade as complete "
"acceptance, cached successful reports or commit-gate bypasses."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:191
msgid "软件交付与后续 HIL"
msgstr "Software delivery and subsequent HIL"

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:193
msgid ""
"软件退出需要：公共合同有真实消费者；三后端在明确范围内保持同一业务源码； 失败及退出路径完成；选定存储与源码可裁剪；外部示例、Source SDK 和 "
"CPU Runtime 完成各自验证；当前合同、中英文说明和实际行为一致。不能以本页发布代替这些条件。"
msgstr ""
"Software exit requires real consumers of public contracts; one business "
"source across the three backends within explicit scope; complete failure and"
" teardown paths; selectable storage and source; independent validation of "
"external examples, Source SDK and CPU Runtime; and agreement among current "
"contracts, Chinese and English documentation, and actual behavior. "
"Publishing this page does not satisfy those conditions."

#: ../../../../docs/development/os-portability-plan.md:197
msgid ""
"物理 IRQ 到唤醒延迟、调度抖动、真实栈峰值、低功耗时间连续性、FP／MVE 切换和 安全隔离保持独立 HIL 验收，当前按用户安排暂缓，状态保留 "
"`not_executed`。 它们不阻塞已明确边界的软件交付，也不能被 Native、模型或 ARM 链接结果标成通过。 "
"不设无测量依据的绝对性能门槛；发现资源回归先解释对应能力与对等基线，再决定取舍。"
msgstr ""
"Physical IRQ-to-wake latency, scheduling jitter, actual stack peaks, low-"
"power clock continuity, FP/MVE switching and security isolation retain "
"separate HIL acceptance. As arranged by the user, they are deferred and "
"remain `not_executed`. They do not block software delivery with explicit "
"boundaries, and Native, model or ARM link results cannot mark them as "
"passed. Set no absolute performance thresholds without measurements; explain"
" resource regressions against corresponding capabilities and equivalent "
"baselines before deciding tradeoffs."
